id=ksu_mcp
name=KSU MCP Server
version=v1.3.0
versionCode=5
author=Doubao
description=Rooted-device embedded MCP server (v1.3.0): MCP 2025-11-25, 40 tools — 8 new UI-hierarchy tools (android_get_screen_elements/find_element/tap_element/set_element_text/wait_for_element/scroll_to_element/dump_ui_hierarchy/get_foreground_app) that read the uiautomator control tree and return structured text+id+center coordinates instead of screenshots, plus info/battery/storage/network/logcat/process/settings/input/shell/file tools; watchdog-supervised daemon with tunnel liveness detection; Streamable HTTP + SSE; LAN access; tunnel client with 10s heartbeat/35s dead-detection and quality metrics; zero-jank WebUI. Ships with an installable AI skill pack.
